              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore inaaing'uaa ilo pisiai te nkalo oo ltung'ana le Israel apa naategelayie Musa aitung'uaa ine lelo tung'ana apa ooshomo enjore ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
