          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki lelo kituaak ooitasheiki nkalifuni e njore o lelo arikok loo nkalifuni o lairikok le lelo maa iip aapuonu aanyikaki Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejoki ninche Musa, “Eikena isinkan linono lelo tung'ana le njore ootii abori erikore ang, nemetii oltung'ani oiwuang'a te yiook. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikiyautua iyiook olasar lo Laitoriani, entoki ake ninye nanoto oltung'ani, ntokitin e sahabu, ilkataarri o mankek, o ilgiso, o sakankarri, o saen, pee kipuonu aaitobiraki ate osotua lo lning'o te dukuya Olaitoriani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Musa o Eliesa ilo apolosani neng'amaa te ninche ina sahabu pooki apa naitaaki imasaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina sahabu pooki oo nkishorot naishoo ninche Olaitoriani, eing'uaa lelo arikok le lelo oora nkalifuni le njore, o lelo le maa iip naa shekeli nkalifuni tomon o ile o iip naapishana o onom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ore apa lelo tung'ana le njore newaita nena naatarutua ewa ake oltung'ani nkunenyena.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Musa o Eliesa ilo apolosani neng'amaa ina sahabu te lelo arikok le njore loo nkalifuni, o loo maa iip neyau atua ilo ng'obor le ntumo, pee eaku entoki nadamuni too ltung'ana le Israel te dukuya Olaitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
